  "findings": [
    "Pin-ID and normalized-URL persistent set, no image content hash or byte confirmation; exact-image equality and perceptual matching absent from reviewed dedupe module.",
    "Current-batch seen_here tracks IDs only; different IDs sharing same URL survive same filter call. Persisted URL matching strips query unconditionally and can conflate different resources. Both reproduced.",
    "Store writes truncate in place with no locking/atomic replace. Two separately initialized instances overwrite each other, reproduced ID A lost after B save. Does not prove real concurrent runtime, isolated sequential interleaving only.",
    "Valid JSON list at store root raises uncaught AttributeError; numeric persisted ID differs from string incoming ID; malformed JSON silently resets history after warning. All reproduced in temporary directory.",
    "Metadata scan rebuilds ID/URL history, not file integrity; unreadable history/metadata has no explicit incomplete status.",
    "Downloader accepts any nonempty pin-ID filename as existing, and writes directly to final filename before stream completes; interrupted partial may later be treated as complete. Source finding only, no downloader executed.",
    "Metadata JSON and CSV written sequentially in place, no cross-file transaction; malformed previous JSON overwritten. Original storage/dedupe test methods 2/2 passed in isolated AST harness, not upstream full suite.",
    "Seven tracked PNG screenshots viewed as complete-raster overviews, show web search/gallery/details/settings and CLI output; screenshots are not current end-to-end validation.",
    "Packaging license classifier MIT read; LICENSE and remaining frontend/server/docs still pending. No license-based copying authorized by this partial review.",
    "All remaining Python/docs/HTML/CSS and all 1323 JS lines read. Root MIT license verified; original CI runs compileall/help only, no test execution step.",
    "Job batch_save filters seen pins but final raw_pins overwrites filtered self.pins. In-memory search stub plus original Job._run reproduced previously stored ID surviving dedup=True.",
    "Job empty-result fallback calls re.sub but server.py never imports re; isolated original body raises NameError, reproduced.",
    "CLI adds all collected pins to history even if download failed or size filter skipped; metadata self-heal marks collected ID without confirming local bytes. Never-download-twice and crash-safe README claims exceed implemented guarantees.",
    "Cancellation endpoint sets done before worker has stopped, while thread pool context waits queued work and HTTP requests remain in flight. Source finding only, no server or cancellation thread test.",
    "Frontend deletes body.dedup unconditionally, backend default false; web UI cannot enable dedup from reviewed settings. Full source read, no browser interaction.",
    "Frontend runVisualSearch calls undefined showProgress before try block. Infinite scroll computes PAGE_SIZE slice but passes allPins to renderGrid on append, rendering entire remainder. Source findings only.",
    "SSE queue is destructive across consumers; frontend events are not tied to submission identity and finishJob uses shared currentJob, possible overlapping-job mixup. No live event race reproduced.",
    "Suggestion cache caps values but per-query locks are never evicted; Job registry/visual cache unbounded. No performance claim or third-party scraping performed."
  ],
